<title>USA: Allmerica Financial sets merger close date.</title>
<headline>Allmerica Financial sets merger close date.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allmerica Financial Corp said it expects to close its merger with Allmerica Property &amp; Casualty Cos Inc on or about July 16, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said Allmerica Property &amp; Casualty shareholders will be sent merger consideration election materials following the closing of the transaction. The election deadline is expected to be on or about August 13.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Allmerica Financial will acquire the 40.5 percent of Allmerica P&amp;C that it does not already own.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
